id: high-speed-ace
name: High Speed Ace
talentCategory: mobility
prerequisites: Agility Score of 6+
description: >
  Focused on zipping around the battlefield, you build up momentum and combine it with your fighting style.
text: >
  High Speed Ace: Focused on zipping around the battlefield, you build up momentum and combine it with your fighting style.
  –Prerequisites: Agility Score of 6+
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Defense Value and Speed by 1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: During this Combat Round, if you have moved a total number of Squares that matches or exceeds your Normal Speed through your own effects or Maneuvers, increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T) until the end of this Combat Round.

---

[passive]
# (1) "Speed": the Normal Speed.
defenseValue += 1(T);
speed.normal += 1(T);
# (2) Nothing here counts Squares - moving is the table's. The Movement's card carries a "High Speed Ace" button, once a Round:
# the player says the Normal Speed is reached, their own way - High Speed (a mark), Wound 1(T) till the Round ends (chat.mjs
# takeMoveOffer).
allow highSpeed.wound;
